  {
   "id": "the-chant-152076@1.4.1",
   "gameId": "the-chant-152076",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 1.4.1",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-12-22T08:43:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This patch includes some important combat targeting changes that aim to create a smoother and more responsive experience for our players. For those who have played the game before, we believe these changes will feel quite fresh. Let us know what you think.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your feedback is much appreciated and has served as a basis for the priorities addressed in today’s update and the hotfixes which preceded it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Combat Targeting Tuning to create a smoother and more responsive experience for our players:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Camera now remains consistent when sprinting in combat.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Camera is more responsive to player input when camera auto-targeting is used in combat.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced the amount of jarring camera movements that could happen within combat.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Chapter 6 Boss Tuning and Balancing",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve made more changes to this encounter to address player frustration and feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please continue to report any issues you may encounter while playing The Chant here in the Steam forums or our other channels across the social space.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twitter: https://twitter.com/TheChantGame",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Instagram: https://instagram.com/thechantgame",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Facebook: https://facebook.com/TheChantGame",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
